---
layout: base.njk
title: Home
---
{% set sessions = collections.sessions %}

<!-- HERO -->
<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero__frame">
    <img src="/images/wallpaper.jpg" alt="Old New York under Nether smog"/>
    <div class="hero__scrim"></div>
    <div class="hero__body">
      <div class="hero__kicker">The Campaign</div>
      <h2 class="hero__title">Igniting the Spark</h2>
      {% set firstEntry = sessions | last %}
      <div class="hero__actions">
        {% if firstEntry %}<a href="{{ firstEntry.url }}" class="btn">Start Here →</a>{% endif %}
        <a href="/lore/igniting-the-spark/01-the-campaign/" class="btn btn--ghost">Learn More</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- FEATURED LATEST -->
{% if sessions | length %}
  {% set latest = sessions[0] %}
  <section class="section section--lg">
    <div class="section-label"><span>Latest Entry</span><span class="rule"></span></div>
    <article class="featured featured--noimg">
      <div class="featured__body">
        <div class="eyebrow">
          {%- if latest.data.session %}Play Session {{ latest.data.session }} · {% endif -%}
          {{ latest.date | longDate }}
        </div>
        <h3 class="h-card"><a href="{{ latest.url }}">{{ latest.data.title }}</a></h3>
        <p>{{ latest.templateContent | plainExcerpt(260) }}</p>
        <a href="{{ latest.url }}" class="readmore">Read the entry →</a>
      </div>
    </article>
  </section>
{% endif %}

<!-- ARCHIVE GRID (9 most recent sessions after the featured one) -->
<section class="section">
  <div class="section-label"><span>From the Archive</span><span class="rule"></span></div>
  <div class="grid">
    {% for s in sessions.slice(1, 10) %}
      <a href="{{ s.url }}" class="card">
        <div class="card__top">
          <span class="chip chip--iron">Session</span>
          <span class="card__tag">Session {{ s.data.session }}</span>
        </div>
        <h4 class="card__title">{{ s.data.title }}</h4>
        <p class="card__excerpt">{{ s.templateContent | plainExcerpt(140) }}</p>
        <span class="card__date">{{ s.date | longDate }}</span>
      </a>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
  {% if sessions | length > 1 %}
    <p class="archive-more"><a href="/sessions/" class="readmore">View all sessions →</a></p>
  {% endif %}
</section>

<!-- ABOUT -->
<section class="section">
  <div class="about">
    <div class="about__photo"><img src="/images/nox_outfitted.png" alt="Nox of the Wyld"/></div>
    <div>
      <div class="kicker">The Author</div>
      <h3>Nox Knight</h3>
      <p>Born Ciaran Nightscale under the watchful eyes of gods who orchestrated their very birth, they stepped into adulthood as Nox Knight to face a hidden war within the Iron Veil. These are their pages—kept on parchment that remembers, because ink and blood are the only things that hold a soul’s weight.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
